# SOP-001: Ubuntu Server 24.04 Setup & Hardening

## Purpose
Set up and harden an Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS VM 
on Proxmox for enterprise lab use.

## Environment
- Hypervisor: Proxmox VE 9.1.1
- OS: Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS
- VM Name: ubuntu-lab-01

## Steps Completed
1. Installed Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS
2. Updated system packages
3. Configured OpenSSH with hardening
   - Disabled root login
   - Set MaxAuthTries to 3
4. Configured UFW firewall
   - Allowed SSH (port 22)
   - Default deny incoming
5. Installed and configured fail2ban
   - SSH jail active

## Verification
- UFW Status: Active ✅
- fail2ban Status: Active ✅
- SSH root login: Disabled ✅

